/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 42 0 R
/T (This report covers the step-by-step setup completed on Day 1 of field training. The goal was to set up a laptop as a professional development station for embedded systems using Visual Studio Code. This involved installing the ESP32 code tools, fixing a major USB connection driver problem, writing code to blink an external LED on Pin 18, and uploading the project to GitHub. )
/E (This report covers the step-by-step setup completed on Day 1 of field training. The goal was to set up a laptop as a professional development station for embedded systems using Visual Studio Code. This involved installing the ESP32 code tools, fixing a major USB connection driver problem, writing code to blink an external LED on Pin 18, and uploading the project to GitHub. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
