/P 42 0 R
/T (Computers cannot run embedded C code directly because their built-in processors are different from the chip inside the ESP32. We need a special setup called a cross-compiler to package code on a computer so it can run on the ESP32 hardware.)
/E (Computers cannot run embedded C code directly because their built-in processors are different from the chip inside the ESP32. We need a special setup called a cross-compiler to package code on a computer so it can run on the ESP32 hardware.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
