/T (Problem 2: "No Serial Ports Found" \(Missing Drivers\) When the ESP32 board was plugged into the laptop via a USB cable, VS Code could not find it, and it did not show up in the computer's Device Manager.)
/E (Problem 2: "No Serial Ports Found" \(Missing Drivers\) When the ESP32 board was plugged into the laptop via a USB cable, VS Code could not find it, and it did not show up in the computer's Device Manager.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
