208 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 45 0 R
/T (The Cause Most ESP32 development boards use a small bridge chip \(like the CP210x or CH340\) to let the computer speak to the microchip over USB. The official documentation website didn't install this automatically. Without this driver software, Windows cannot recognize the board.)
/E (The Cause Most ESP32 development boards use a small bridge chip \(like the CP210x or CH340\) to let the computer speak to the microchip over USB. The official documentation website didn't install this automatically. Without this driver software, Windows cannot recognize the board.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
