/Title (This report covers the step-by-step setup completed on Day 1 of field training. The goal was to set up a laptop as a professional development station for embedded systems using Visual Studio Code. This involved installing the ESP32 code tools, fixing a major USB connection driver problem, writing code to blink an external LED on Pin 18, and uploading the project to GitHub.)
